<h1 align="center">🚴 Bike Sales Dashboard Project</h1>

An interactive Excel dashboard project designed to analyze customer purchasing behavior and identify the major factors affecting bike sales.

This project uses Excel tools such as Pivot Tables, Charts, Slicers, Conditional Formatting, and Dashboard Design techniques to transform raw sales data into meaningful business insights.

---

📌 Project Objective

The main objective of this project is to:

* Analyze bike buyer behavior
* Understand customer demographics
* Identify sales trends and patterns
* Create an interactive dashboard for quick business decisions

---

📂 Dataset Information

The dataset contains customer-related information such as:

* Customer Age
* Gender
* Income
* Education
* Occupation
* Marital Status
* Region
* Commute Distance
* Purchased Bike (Yes/No)

The data was cleaned and transformed before visualization.

---

🛠 Tools & Features Used

## Microsoft Excel Features

* Pivot Tables
* Pivot Charts
* Slicers
* Data Cleaning
* Conditional Formatting
* Interactive Dashboard Design
* Excel Functions & Formulas

---

📊 Dashboard Insights

The dashboard provides insights including:

✔ Average Income Analysis

Compares average income between customers who purchased bikes and those who did not.

✔ Customer Age Analysis

Identifies which age groups are more likely to purchase bikes.

✔ Commute Distance Trends

Analyzes how commuting distance impacts bike purchases.

✔ Regional Sales Insights

Shows purchasing behavior across different regions.

✔ Interactive Filtering

Users can filter data dynamically using slicers.

